OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Apalling' failures at trust over
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandfather who died after surgery at
OL,7,Fa Brighton hospital would have "more
OL,8,Flikely survived" if he was offered
OL,9,Fother treatments, a coroner said.
OL,11,FArthur Brooke Craig, 77, was given no
OL,12,Ffluids for 24 hours after his operation
OL,13,Fat the Royal Sussex County Hospital by
OL,14,Funder-fire surgeon Dr Marc Lamah, and
OL,15,Fdoctors were unaware that he had heart
OL,16,Fproblems despite it being in his
OL,17,Fmedical notes.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
