OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1787849748
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Apalling' failures at trust over
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis daughter, Professor Cathy Craig
OL,7,Fsaid the family raised a "series of
OL,8,Fgrave concerns" over her father's care
OL,9,Fand they "got some answers" from the
OL,10,Finquest.
OL,12,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex, which runs
OL,13,Fthe hospital, said it "offers our
OL,14,Fsincere condolences to Mr Craig's
OL,15,Ffamily" and apologised for failings in
OL,16,Fhis care.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
